  In particular, if `boxes = [[0, 0, 1, 1]]`, the method will give identical
  results to using `tf.compat.v1.image.resize_bilinear()` or
  `tf.compat.v1.image.resize_nearest_neighbor()`(depends on the `method`
  argument) with
